One load screen per era per mode. If you've got Conquest and Hero Assault you can have two conquest screens and one Hero Assault screen. You just have to a) Load it up in each LUA and b) in your common.req file where it says\nCode:\nSelect all\nucft
{
    REQN
    {
        "texture"
        "loadscreen"
    }
}\nYou need to add in your other textures... :\nCode:\nSelect all\nucft
{
    REQN
    {
        "texture"
        "loadscreen"
        "loadscreen2"
        "loadscreen3"
    }
}

